38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, wait! The office cleaner costs four thousand two hundred yen an hour! That’s way more than our two thousand three hundred yen in supplies.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
